        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Why Linux Containers (LXC)</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    width: 1024px;\n    min-height: 768px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 20px 40px 20px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n  }\n  .logo-placeholder {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 45px;\n    color: #bbb;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border: none;\n  }\n  hr {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 2px solid #999;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  ul.level1 {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 0;\n  }\n  ul.level1 > li {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  ul.level1 > li::before {\n    content: \"▪\";\n    color: #2E75B6;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 3px;\n  }\n  ul.level2 {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n    padding-left: 30px;\n  }\n  ul.level2 > li {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  ul.level2 > li::before {\n    content: \"–\";\n    color: #000;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 15px;\n    left: 40px;\n    right: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n  .footer .center {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  sup {\n    font-size: 70%;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1>Why Linux Containers (LXC)</h1>\n    <div class=\"logo-placeholder\">[Logo: IBM]</div>\n  </div>\n  <hr>\n  <ul class=\"level1\">\n    <li>Fast\n      <ul class=\"level2\">\n        <li>Runtime performance near bare metal speeds</li>\n        <li>Management operations (run, stop , start, etc.) in seconds / milliseconds</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Agile\n      <ul class=\"level2\">\n        <li>VM-like agility &ndash; it&rsquo;s still &ldquo;virtualization&rdquo;</li>\n        <li>Seamlessly &ldquo;migrate&rdquo; between virtual and bare metal environments</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Flexible\n      <ul class=\"level2\">\n        <li>Containerize a &ldquo;system&rdquo;</li>\n        <li>Containerize &ldquo;application(s)&rdquo;</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Lightweight\n      <ul class=\"level2\">\n        <li>Just enough Operating System (JeOS)</li>\n        <li>Minimal per container penalty</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Inexpensive\n      <ul class=\"level2\">\n        <li>Open source &ndash; free &ndash; lower TCO</li>\n        <li>Supported with out-of-the-box modern Linux kernel</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Ecosystem\n      <ul class=\"level2\">\n        <li>Growing in popularity</li>\n        <li>Vibrant community &amp; numerous 3<sup>rd</sup> party apps</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <span>5/11/2014</span>\n    <span class=\"center\">Document v2.0</span>\n    <span>5</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
